@PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5280

### Login (obter JWT)
POST {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=cliente@exemplo.pt&password=Password1!

### Refresh token
POST {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=COLOCAR_REFRESH_TOKEN

### Entregas do utilizador autenticado
GET {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer COLOCAR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### Versao da app (publico)
GET {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/app/version
Accept: application/json

###
